    "notes": [
      "Depends on the landed Phase 38 repository-owned Firefox extension overlay.",
      "Gradle and the Android runtime use BrowserExtensionPackageGenerator, so identical inputs produce byte-identical XPIs and the same SHA-256 across device time zones.",
      "The app exports through a persisted OpenDocumentTree URI after cache generation, archive validation, staged provider write, reopen, byte-count verification, and checksum verification.",
      "Providers without rename support use a verified local snapshot before replacing an existing XPI, with restoration on failure.",
      "Generated extension packages are build or runtime outputs and are not committed to source control.",
      "Phase 39 supplies Dark and AMOLED package presets; the shared XDM theme-token contract and themed page FAB belong to Phase 40.",
      "No top-level route, Room migration, transfer-engine behavior, app version, or custom-scheme payload expansion is introduced."
    ]
